{"translation":{"id":"fra_jnd","name":"Bible J.N. Darby","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=frajnd","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=frajnd","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"JND","englishName":"French: Bible J.N. Darby","language":"fra","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"121a3f4841e42965f22ebebcf5a8578a12578ec30eaf1ca7ae4e46d5d85ccb80","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/fra_jnd/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31170,"languageName":"français","languageEnglishName":"French"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"fra_jnd","name":"Les Psaumes","commonName":"Les Psaumes","title":"Les Psaumes","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"4c48a766d24644f7ef347ae1395ef8ddb5d363cc30acf1733162d22f071b120e","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/fra_jnd/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/fra_jnd/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2527},"chapter":{"number":123,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"Cantique des degrés. J’élève mes yeux vers toi, qui habites dans les cieux.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Voici, comme les yeux des serviteurs [regardent] à la main de leurs maîtres, comme les yeux de la servante à la main de sa maîtresse, ainsi nos yeux [regardent] à l’Éternel, notre Dieu, jusqu’à ce qu’il use de grâce envers nous.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Use de grâce envers nous, ô Éternel ! use de grâce envers nous ; car nous sommes, outre mesure, rassasiés de mépris.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Nos âmes sont, outre mesure, rassasiées des insultes de ceux qui sont à l’aise, du mépris des orgueilleux.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/fra_jnd/PSA/123.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/fra_jnd/PSA/124.json","nextChapter